List and test the notification targets

Usage:
  nexoctl admin notify targets [flags]
  nexoctl admin notify targets [command]

Available Commands:
  list        List the notification targets with their state
  test        Send a test event (s3:TestEvent) to a notification target

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for targets

Global Flags:
      --config-dir string   configuration directory (default $NEXOCTL_CONFIG_DIR or ~/.nexoctl)
      --debug               dump the HTTP requests and responses on stderr, with the secrets redacted
      --json                print JSON Lines (one object per line with a "status" member)
      --no-color            disable colors (also with the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -q, --quiet               hide confirmations and progress (results and errors are still printed)

Use "nexoctl admin notify targets [command] --help" for more information about a command.
